## Why this license

`nirs4all-io` reuses ("copies and re-orchestrates") business logic from the
[`nirs4all`](https://github.com/GBeurier/nirs4all) library, whose default
open-source license is **AGPL-3.0-or-later** with **CeCILL-2.1** as an accepted
variant. Matching that dual offering keeps the copied logic license-compatible
(see [`COPY_PROVENANCE.md`](COPY_PROVENANCE.md)). Both projects are owned by the
same author, who authorizes this use.

Recommended SPDX header for source files:

    # SPDX-License-Identifier: CeCILL-2.1 OR AGPL-3.0-or-later
